    (uuid "4e072e88-c33b-e25a-ab6c-0579d5a36a15"))
  (text "Note 2  C1 and C2 are DNP. If fitted, fit BOTH with the same value: the" (exclude_from_sim yes) (at 132.08 118.11 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (face "Monospace")) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "dab2d744-9eab-13b1-f119-8e863ddae8fc"))
  (text "        current is the difference of the two channels, so asymmetric" (exclude_from_sim yes) (at 132.08 121.92 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (face "Monospace")) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "2ab57062-03be-2c26-210d-831a50ca5a91"))
  (text "        filtering feeds the full supply ripple into the current reading" (exclude_from_sim yes) (at 132.08 125.73 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (face "Monospace")) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "e121adb6-ed4d-588f-2d1f-13ca717c62d5"))
  (text "        instead of cancelling it. A capacitor on node A alone also stretches" (exclude_from_sim yes) (at 132.08 129.54 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (face "Monospace")) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "4b5ffee1-bd1e-9b0c-98d3-0ada46a5776a"))
  (text "        the settle time and blocks the pulsed measurement while cooling." (exclude_from_sim yes) (at 132.08 133.35 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (face "Monospace")) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "ef297a08-2677-7293-b8eb-1d1644531676"))
  (text "Note 3  Tie the 19 V supply ground to module ground. Power MOD1 from USB-C," (exclude_from_sim yes) (at 132.08 140.97 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (face "Monospace")) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "27a8259e-8fb9-39b9-68ca-cb7c70cd01cb"))
  (text "        not from the 19 V rail." (exclude_from_sim yes) (at 132.08 144.78 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (face "Monospace")) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "fd28198e-3dff-a883-32eb-34c10502e5ab"))
  (text "Note 4  R2 keeps a defined current flowing with no probe fitted, so" (exclude_from_sim yes) (at 132.08 152.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (face "Monospace")) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "58e45d89-aee5-c408-1762-1a586a0818ae"))
  (text "        open-circuit detection cannot read a plausible value off a floating" (exclude_from_sim yes) (at 132.08 156.21 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (face "Monospace")) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "20dba933-00d9-4530-fed9-7ffe9ac1e08e"))
  (text "        node. It is divided out in firmware: R_DIV_A = 110k || 1M = 99.1k." (exclude_from_sim yes) (at 132.08 160.02 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (face "Monospace")) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "8527a489-5807-1b0a-2d91-5b9485939a0d"))
  (text "Note 5  GPIO32/33 are on ADC1. ADC2 is unusable while WiFi is active." (exclude_from_sim yes) (at 132.08 167.64 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (face "Monospace")) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "b6475304-8137-0d45-d0e6-e44f349009da"))
  (text "        GPIO0 and GPIO35 are the on-board buttons, no external wiring." (exclude_from_sim yes) (at 132.08 171.45 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (face "Monospace")) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "fbf356cf-6b72-37d1-9bff-f0ef8c5fd5b4"))
  (text "WARNING Not intrinsically safe. Do not test in fuel oil or a hazardous area." (exclude_from_sim yes) (at 132.08 179.07 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (face "Monospace")) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "f21fbd34-d5bd-c659-1bbd-f239e801c97b"))
